| Component  | Choice                              |
| ---------- | ----------------------------------- |
| UI         | React.js + Tailwind                 |
| Backend    | FastAPI (Python)                    |
| Hashing    | Python hashlib                      |
| Scraper    | Scrapy / BeautifulSoup / Playwright |
| DB         | SQLite or MongoDB (if scaling)      |
| Exports    | JSON, ZIP, Screenshots, PDFs        |
| Extensions | GPT API, IPFS, GitHub API           |

