## 🔄 Suggested Setup

* Local dev with Docker or simple virtual env
* Build frontend and backend separately but API-connected
* Can run on your laptop or future containerized VPS
* Optional: Set up **Vault Trigger Agent** as a cron job for hourly or keyword-based scans

